# Open 15.1
tags: open, benchmark, 2015
stimulus: Midline, pull and a light barbell; hold a repeatable round pace for nine minutes.
score: reps
note: Immediately followed by Open 15.1a, a separate score: from 9:00 to 15:00, build to a 1-rep-max clean and jerk.
AMRAP 9:00
  15 Toes-to-bar
  10 Deadlift 115/75 lb
  5 Snatch 115/75 lb
